# Records assets/demo.gif with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
#   vhs demo.tape
Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "mannerly pip3"
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "mannerly --explain output.closed-pipe"
Enter
Sleep 4s
